# Survey Team: no camera fly on play

The player does **not** want the camera to move when they play the **Survey Team** card (`ScoutingCardSO.SurveyDrone` → `BeginFromCard` / `ArmSurveyFromCard`).

## Do not

- Call `FlyCameraToNearestSurveyTarget` or `PlayerInput.FlyCameraToWorldPosition` from Survey Team card `Apply()` or survey paint **arm** paths
- Re-add “fly to nearest ?” when Survey Team is clicked from the hand

## OK elsewhere

- **Orbital Scan**, building placement (`CardPlayCameraGuide`), boot camera, diagnostics — unchanged unless the player says otherwise
- In-world survey crew walking the painted path after **OK** — that is gameplay, not camera automation

## On Survey Team UX changes

Use `EnsureMarkersForActiveObjectives()`, HUD hints, and player-chosen `?` clicks — not camera fly.